{"id":4239,"date":"2017-10-06T22:28:18","date_gmt":"2017-10-07T02:28:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=4239"},"modified":"2017-10-06T22:28:18","modified_gmt":"2017-10-07T02:28:18","slug":"airstream-factory-tour","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/10\/06\/airstream-factory-tour\/","title":{"rendered":"Airstream Factory Tour"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Our next workamping gig is at the Livingston, TX headquarters of the Escapees RV Club.<\/p>\n<p>We left Ohio this morning after spending about 10 days visiting family and many of our good friends (we didn&#8217;t have time to see everybody), checking in with our doctors, doing a little banking and helping our daughter and son-in-law with some tasks that needed done at their new home, (our former home that they purchased from us a couple months ago.)<\/p>\n<p>We&#8217;re taking a leisurely drive to Texas, I mapped it out asking Google Maps to &#8220;avoid highways&#8221; so that we will stay on the state and county roads and not the interstate.\u00a0 It&#8217;s not that I dislike driving the interstate, but since we have the time (2 weeks to get there), we thought it might prove to be a little more interesting going through some small towns and rural areas along the way.<\/p>\n<p>Our first stop was in <a href=\"http:\/\/www.jacksoncenter.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jackson Center, Ohio<\/a> where the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.airstream.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Airstream travel trailers<\/a> are made.\u00a0 We have a particular interest in Airstream since our Class A diesel motor home was made by <a href=\"https:\/\/www.airstream.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Airstream<\/a> back in 2002.\u00a0 Unfortunately they quit making the full size Class A coaches in 2006 when the bottom dropped out of the country&#8217;s economy.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4240\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4240\" style=\"width: 618px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/JacksonCtrMap.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4240\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/JacksonCtrMap.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"618\" height=\"520\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/JacksonCtrMap.jpg 618w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/JacksonCtrMap-300x252.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 618px) 100vw, 618px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4240\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Map to Jackson Center, OH<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>The tour started at 2 p.m. in the front lobby and our tour guide (Don) shared a lot of knowledge with us as he had worked at the factory &#8220;forever&#8221; as he put it and retired 28 years ago but is still employed as one of the tour guides.\u00a0 He knows the shop, the folks on the shop floor, and everyone knows him.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4241\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4241\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.01.06.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4241 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.01.06.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.01.06.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.01.06-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.01.06-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.01.06-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4241\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The group standing in the lobby listening to the introduction<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4242\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4242\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-13.58.07.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4242 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-13.58.07.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-13.58.07.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-13.58.07-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-13.58.07-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-13.58.07-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4242\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kathy in the gift shop &#8211; Go figure, eh?<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4243\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4243\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.35.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4243 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.35.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.35.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.35-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.35-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.35-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4243\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">A really cool desk made from the back end of an Airstream trailer<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4244\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4244\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.22.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4244 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.22.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.22.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.22-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.22-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.22-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4244\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">There&#8217;s a color TV in the back of that trailer mock-up<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4245\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4245\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.17.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4245 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.17.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.17.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.17-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.17-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-12.42.17-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4245\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The main lobby at the factory and service\/parts center<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Sadly, they wouldn&#8217;t allow any pictures of the production floor, so I was only able to get a few outside pix and one of the service garage.<\/p>\n<p>Wally Byam started building Airstream trailers in 1931 out in California and in 1952 the company was moved to it&#8217;s present location at Jackson Center, OH.\u00a0 Don shared with us that they build about 100 units a week, currently with a backlog of about 2500 trailers.\u00a0 The folks on the floor work a 40 hour week, 4 nine hour days and a short 4 hour day on Friday.\u00a0 They&#8217;re paid starting at $18\/ hour and the plant is clean and bright (but noisy!)\u00a0 We were all given ear plugs and safety glasses.<\/p>\n<p>They continue to introduce new models, but their most popular units are the 16&#8242; Bambi and the 23&#8242; Classic.\u00a0 Their newer models include the very popular BaseCamp and the Nest.\u00a0 Although we saw some new, not yet released models, our tour guide could not talk about them and whisked us along on the tour.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4248\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4248\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.14.05.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4248 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.14.05.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.14.05.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.14.05-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.14.05-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-14.14.05-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4248\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Leaving the front lobby, walking past the 24 bay service garage toward one of the plant buildings<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4249\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4249\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.23.00.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4249 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.23.00.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.23.00.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.23.00-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.23.00-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.23.00-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4249\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Finishing up the plant tour, walking past a new unit that Don couldn&#8217;t talk to us about, not yet introduced<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4250\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4250\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.27.24.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4250 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.27.24.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.27.24.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.27.24-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.27.24-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.27.24-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4250\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The back side of the service garage with an old Argosy motor home in the distance<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4251\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4251\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.29.07.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4251 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.29.07.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.29.07.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.29.07-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.29.07-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.29.07-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4251\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Inside the service garage (24 bays). Notice how clean and bright it is. The inside of the plant is likewise bright and clean<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4252\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4252\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.56.17.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4252 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.56.17.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.56.17.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.56.17-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.56.17-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-15.56.17-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4252\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">That&#8217;s Kathy with her bag of goodies from the gift shop (go figure)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4253\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4253\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-19.22.30.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4253 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-19.22.30.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-19.22.30.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-19.22.30-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-19.22.30-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-02-19.22.30-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4253\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Our spot for the night at the Airstream &#8220;Terraport&#8221; along with about 20 other units. They have two circles for campers.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>The tours run Monday through Thursday at 2 p.m. and run about 1-1\/2 hours.\u00a0 I&#8217;m sorry I couldn&#8217;t share photos from the production floor, but that&#8217;s company policy.<\/p>\n<p>Whether or not you own an Airstream (or dream of owning one), this plant tour is interesting and enjoyable.\u00a0 If you find yourself in Ohio on a weekday, take a drive over.\u00a0 I think you&#8217;ll enjoy seeing how their quality products are made and the pride the employees put into their work.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Our next workamping gig is at the Livingston, TX headquarters of the Escapees RV Club. We left Ohio this morning after spending about 10 days visiting family and many of our good friends (we didn&#8217;t have time to see everybody), checking in with our doctors, doing a little banking and helping our daughter and son-in-law &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/10\/06\/airstream-factory-tour\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Airstream Factory Tour<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[18285,264,19546],"tags":[612542,554707471],"class_list":["post-4239","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-equipment","category-learning","category-sightseeing","tag-airstream","tag-jackson-center"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4239","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4239"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4239\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4258,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4239\/revisions\/4258"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4239"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4239"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4239"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}